{
  "title": "Suffix IT Limited : Software Company in Bangladesh",
  "text": "Home\nAbout\nProducts\nIoT\nServices\nCareer\nContact\nVideo Conferencing\nHomeVideo Conferencing\nGet Ultimate Experience\nInternet meetings, training & technical assistance\nBuilding collaboration-enabled meeting rooms\nNext-generation business phone system\nMarketing activities & discussions in Town Hall\nKey Features\nChat\n\nSend public and private messages.\n\nAudio\n\nCommunicate using high quality audio.\n\nWebcams\n\nHold visual meetings.\n\nEmojis\n\nExpress yourself.\n\nBreakout Rooms\n\nGroup users into breakout rooms for team collaboration.\n\nScreen Sharing\n\nShare your screen.\n\nPolling\n\nPoll your users anytime.\n\nMulti-user whiteboard\n\nDraw together.\n\nWhy Suffix Video Conferencing\nSimple to use, Purchase & Scale\nMost affordable\nBuilt & configured to work reliably\nOne clear client experience for all use cases\nResources designed to match teachers\n\nThe Suffix Video Conferencing Platform allows students to share their audio, images, chat, video and screen. Built-in polling makes it easy for students to engage and recording your lectures means you can make them available for later review.\n\nAnybody can share a webcam\n\nThere's no limit to how many webcams you can share in a session (limited by bandwidth only.\n\nWhiteboard live for presenters and groups\n\nAnnotations are automatically shown back to the students in real-time while using the whiteboard device. Presenters do have the option to zoom, highlight, draw and write on presentations to make the points easier for students who are far away.\n\nSchedule a Live Demo\nGo for a free practical demonstration in order to experience the user friendly platform of Suffix Field Force Management.\nREQUEST FOR A DEMO\n\nWe maintain strategic partnerships with multiple organizations in Bangladesh and worldwide, working together to deliver high-quality solutions and long-term value.\n\nCONTACT US\n\nCha-70,70/A, Rupayan Millennium Square (9A), Progoti Sharoni, North Badda, Gulshan, Dhaka-1212.\n\ninfo@suffixit.com\n\n+88 01958 424000\n\nQUICK LINKS\nAbout Us\nCareer\nContact Us\n\n© 2026 All Rights Reserved by Suffix IT Limited",
